### Food Delivery Platform - Search Service
### Written for the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### Search is public: no token needed (only the admin overview needs an admin's access token).
###
### What is searchable comes from Kafka events (RestaurantChanged, CategoryChanged, MenuItemChanged), indexed
### into Elasticsearch (indexes: restaurant, food, category). MySQL in restaurant- and catalog-service stays the
### source of truth. Data created before Phase 11 is not in Kafka: run the REINDEX section once to fill the indexes.
###
### Prerequisites: run restaurant-service.http and catalog-service.http first (an ACTIVE restaurant in Bengaluru
### with a menu).

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@fooddelivery.local
@adminPassword = ChangeMe123
# Every call carries the access token of a sign-in above (valid 15 minutes: sign in again after that).
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### ============================ REINDEX (once) ============================

### 1. Admin login -> adminToken
# @name adminLogin
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

### 2. Replay every restaurant, category and menu item as events (run all three; audited, changes no data)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/restaurants/events/republish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/categories/events/republish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/menu-items/events/republish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. A few seconds later: how much is indexed, and is Elasticsearch healthy
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/search/indexes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ============================ RESTAURANTS ============================

### 4. Words in name, cuisines and description; typos are fine ("biryni")
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/restaurants?q=biryni&city=Bengaluru

### 5. All restaurants of a city by name, with the cuisines facet (counts per cuisine)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/restaurants?city=bengaluru

### 6. One cuisine (any letter case)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/restaurants?cuisine=north indian

### 7. Near me: nearest first, with distanceKm (restaurants need coordinates in their address)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/restaurants?lat=12.9716&lon=77.5946&radiusKm=10


### ============================ DISHES ============================

### 8. Dishes across all restaurants that can be ordered now (listed, in stock, restaurant ACTIVE)
###    Facets: foodTypes and categories with counts
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/foods?q=chicken biryani&city=Bengaluru

### 9. Vegetarian, under 250, cheapest first
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/foods?foodType=VEG&maxPrice=250&sort=PRICE_LOW_TO_HIGH

### 10. One restaurant's dishes in one category
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/foods?restaurantId=1&categoryId=3

### 10b. Best rated dishes first (then most ratings; unrated last), only 4 stars and up
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/foods?minRating=4&sort=RATING

### 10c. Best rated restaurants first, only 4.5 and up (every hit shows ratingAverage and ratingCount)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/restaurants?city=Bengaluru&minRating=4.5&sort=RATING


### ====================== CATEGORIES AND AUTOCOMPLETE ======================

### 11. Every active category in menu order, or the ones matching words
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/categories

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/categories?q=sweets

### 12. Search as you type: word beginnings ("chi bir" -> "Chicken Biryani"), up to 5 of each kind
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search/suggest?q=chi bir&city=Bengaluru


### ========================= OPERATIONS =========================

### Copy the ratings from review-service into the indexes now (also runs every minute); platform admin only
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/search/ratings/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Health (direct)
GET http://localhost:8088/actuator/health

### Elasticsearch itself (direct): cluster health, indexes, the food mapping
GET http://localhost:9200/_cluster/health

###
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/indices?v

###
GET http://localhost:9200/food/_mapping

### Swagger UI: http://localhost:8088/swagger-ui.html
GET http://localhost:8088/v3/api-docs
